#: kcmlocale.cpp:2063
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<qt>This changes the units used by most KDE programs to display numbers counted in bytes. Traditionally \"kilobytes\" meant units of 1024, instead of the metric 1000, for most (but not all) byte sizes."
#| "<ul>"
#| "<li>To reduce confusion you can use the recently standardized IEC units which are always in multiples of 1024.</li>"
